Begin3
Title:          DosView
Description:    Image viewer/converter for modern image formats
Summary:        DosView can view and convert images. Supported formats are BMP, PCX, TGA, LBM, QOI, JPG, PNG, WEBP, TIFF, JPEG 2000, PBM, PPM, RAS, GIF, PSD, HDR, PIC
Keywords:       java, JavaScript
